 en from Dhanbad.\nThe Moon is 20° up in the WSW · twilight.\nTimes again
 st the real lunar limb.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Moon's edge: ht
 tps://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?city=Dhanbad
